    "passage": "To: Drama Workshop Participants\n\nFrom: Sprinson Community Theater\n\nDate: May 27\n\nSubject: A cting with Sarah Gallos class\n\nDear Workshop Participants,\n\nWe are looking forward to seeing you on Monday, June 3, for A cting with Sarah Gallos.\nWhen you enter Sprinson Community Theater, please ---【143】 ______--- directly to the theater\nstage. We will meet there each day at 8:00 A.M. for a brief--【144】 ______--- and then split into\nsmall groups.\n\nIn the mornings, we will focus on improvisation exercises. We will continue in our groups\nin the afternoons until 3:30 P.M. ---【145】 ______---. Dress in ---【146】 ______--- footwear and clothing.\nDoing so will enable you to move about freely on the stage. Of course, you should also\nbe prepared to have fun!\n\nBest,\n\nDenise Gordon\n\nProgram Coordinator",
